{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_02",
  "title": "叛亂前哨",
  "storyCode": "TW-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2a918326d0b0c7a241832ee5c008082a88b8612bd5c68ded5b5776b3fcd67d59",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 2上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "3:59 P.M.    天氣/多雲\n移動城鎮沃倫姆德，感染者居住區，十二音街道"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "亞葉姐姐......你在生氣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "他們的態度意味著什麼，我太清楚了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "但是，但是安托不會有事的，她比我們任何人都熟悉萊塔尼亞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "嗯！安托姐姐一定沒事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "但願......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "總覺得這附近有點安靜得可怕......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "嗯，跟緊點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "看上去不光有普通的居民，還有很多感染者，不過這不是重點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "剛才阻止那些暴徒的時候我就在想了，這個街道的規模，怎麼看都只是普通的街區吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "只是把感染者們集中起來生活，並沒有什麼明面上的差別對待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "但實際上，感染者依舊被約束了人身自由，而且除了那些能夠“物盡其用”的感染者，大部分人這輩子和坐牢沒什麼區別......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "只不過牢獄變成了一條街道，多了幾十倍的獄友罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "看這兒，這家麵包店多久沒有開過門了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "啊......我好像看到源石蟲爬過去了......好不衛生啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "店門口的灰塵和落葉都沒人打掃，這個社區沒有在正常運作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "雖說是在特殊時期，但街上見不到一個買賣麵包的人？公共交通也停擺了，這也太不自然了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "因為，因為之前的事情？店主被嚇走了之類的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "但至少他們還有活著的權利，他們——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "亞葉姐姐......！聲音小點！噓！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......我沒有在指責他們，我只是說......關於“武裝感染者”的話題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "他們會是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "那個憲兵提到了“薩卡茲”，這是首先要確定的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "如果真的和我們所知道的“感染者武裝組織”有關，我們必須警覺起來。這裡的情況也許比那個憲兵說的還要複雜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "如果感染者的情況夠好，那只是因為處境還不夠絕望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "他們肯定還有事情瞞著我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "亞葉姐姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "不用那麼緊張喔，安托姐姐可是很聰明的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "從剛才開始，亞葉姐姐就一直是很可怕的狀態嘛。沒關係的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "只要我們好好努力，就能出色地解決這件事，就像各位幹員前輩那樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "所以稍微放輕鬆一點吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......哈，我又被小麗薩安慰了？這是怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "嘿嘿，煩惱不分大小啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "二位，請稍等——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "是你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "我記得我說過我們不需要幫助，只需要權限就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "抱歉，雖然亞葉小姐那麼說了，但是畢竟情況特殊，二位人生地不熟的，如果出了什麼意外，我們無法承擔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "......亞葉姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "好吧......如果有本地人在身邊，也許這裡的居民也不會這麼害怕我們了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "沒錯！咳咳！十二音街道原本是沃倫姆德最大的感染者聚集區......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "不過現在因為某些原因，這裡也是抗議者最多的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "所以亞葉小姐，現在打算怎麼做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "其實我並不是很建議深入這裡......不過如果您想瞭解沃倫姆德的現狀，這的確是個好選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......先四處逛逛吧，沒必要操之過急。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "如果你願意說點關於安托醫生的事情，我會很高興的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "亞葉小姐......真的很關心安托醫生呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "她是我的同學，是我為數不多的好友，更是羅德島不可或缺的成員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "......是嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "啊，請往這邊走，這裡是通往秋千廣場的路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "安托在這裡做了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "啊......醫治這裡的感染者，幫助那些被感染的人做心理輔導。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "因為天災信使的失誤，沃倫姆德鎮沒能在大裂谷出現前及時避開，遭到了不小的損失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "安托醫生有機會離開這裡，但是她選擇了留下。沃倫姆德停泊在現在的位置之後，她建立起了臨時醫療據點，為了更好地安置感染者們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "安托醫生她......被當做這裡感染者們的英雄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......這是她應該做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "嗯，沒錯，比起死板的學習，她果然更適合實踐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......呵呵，是啊，真好，我都能想像到她一臉得意的樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "亞葉小姐，這是您造訪沃倫姆德後第一次笑容呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......有嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "今天的亞葉姐姐大部分時間都很嚇人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "欸......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "前面......前面有好多人，這附近的人都聚集在這裡了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......不用管？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "只是聚在一起的話，也不能成為逮捕他們的理由吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "他們看過來了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鎮民",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "怎麼突然就安靜下來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "......不，情況不太對......他們在聽誰說話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "站在他們身後的，站在人群最後的那個——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "是個，薩卡茲嗎......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "薩卡茲......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鈴蘭",
      "text": "亞葉姐姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亞葉",
      "text": "我知道！有人衝過來了！喂，你，注意保護好自己！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "text": "是、是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
